{"id":"755fd628447a","path":"/en/university/organisation/structure/organisational-chart","lang":"en","title":"Organisational chart","description":"The Università della Svizzera italiana (USI) is an independent institution regulated by the Swiss public law and it is separated from public administration.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Organisation","Organisational structure"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-organigramma-en.jpg?itok=mY5XbK6r","words":90,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/organizzazione/struttura/organigramma","en":"/en/university/organisation/structure/organisational-chart"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/university"},{"label":"Organisation","path":"/en/university/organisation"},{"label":"Organisational structure","path":"/en/university/organisation/structure"},{"label":"Organisational chart","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/press-usi-organigramma-en.jpg?itok=mY5XbK6r","alt":"Organisational chart of Università della Svizzera italiana","caption":"Organisational chart of Università della Svizzera italiana"}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>The Università della Svizzera italiana (USI) is an independent institution regulated by the Swiss public law and it is separated from public administration. According to the <a href=\"http://www3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/raccolta-leggi/legge/numero/5.3.1.1\">Law on the Università della Svizzera italiana</a> and the <a href=\"https://www3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/index.php/raccolta-leggi/legge/vid/05_126\">related implementing regulation</a>, USI carries out its mandate thorough a service contract stipulated with the <a href=\"http://www.ti.ch/\">Republic and Canton of Ticino</a>.</strong></p> <p>Its organisational structure is defined by the <a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/press/press-usi-statuto-it.pdf\">Statute of the Università della Svizzera italiana</a>.</p><p><strong>More information</strong>:</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/university-council\">University Council</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/rectorate\">Rector and Rectorate</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/academic-senate\">Academic Senate</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/structure-faculties-and-institutes\">Faculties and Institutes: organisation</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/structure/commissions\">Commissions</a></li> <li><a href=\"/en/university/organisation/administration-and-services\">Administration and services</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[],"links":[{"label":"+41 58 666 4338","href":"tel:+41586664338"},{"label":"giovanni.zavaritt@usi.ch","href":"mailto:giovanni.zavaritt@usi.ch"},{"label":"Law on USI","href":"http://www3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/raccolta-leggi/legge/numero/5.3.1.1"},{"label":"Law on USI implementing regulation","href":"https://www3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/index.php/raccolta-leggi/legge/vid/05_126"},{"label":"All official documents","href":"/originalnode/120"},{"label":"USI Statute (in Italian) (PDF 552.43 KB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/press-usi-statuto-it.pdf"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/organisation/structure/organisational-chart","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T15:05:14.180Z"}